  "HDFS-17306": {
    "jira_id": "HDFS-17306",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "RBF:Router should not return nameservices that does not enable observer nodes in RpcResponseHeaderProto",
    "description": "      If a cluster has 3 nameservices: ns1, ns2,ns3, and  ns1 has observer nodes, and client via DFSRouter comminutes with nns.\r\n\r\n      If DFS_ROUTER_OBSERVER_READ_DEFAULT_KEY enable,  the client will receive all nameservices in RpcResponseHeaderProto. \r\n\r\n       We should reduce rpc response size if nameservices don't enable observer nodes.\r\n\r\n ",
